{"suttaId":"thag1.110","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[634,642],"vripara":"110"},"segments":{"thag1.110:0.4":"Usabhattheragāthā","thag1.110:1.1":"“Nagā nagaggesu susaṃvirūḷhā,","thag1.110:1.2":"udaggameghena navena sittā;","thag1.110:1.3":"Vivekakāmassa araññasaññino,","thag1.110:1.4":"janeti bhiyyo usabhassa kalyata”nti. …","thag1.110:1.5":"Usabho thero….","thag1.110:1.6":"Vaggo ekādasamo niṭṭhito.","thag1.110:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","thag1.110:2.1":"Belaṭṭhāniko setuccho,","thag1.110:2.2":"bandhuro khitako isi;","thag1.110:2.3":"Malitavambho suhemanto,","thag1.110:2.4":"dhammasavo dhammasavapitā;","thag1.110:2.5":"Saṅgharakkhitatthero ca,","thag1.110:2.6":"usabho ca mahāmunīti. 12."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Th-a-i","bookName":"Theragāthā-1-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0508a1.att","from":2676,"to":2676,"paras":[{"para":2676,"vripara":null,"refs":["thag1.110:1"],"lines":["Tattha <b>nagā</b>ti rukkhā, “nāgā”ti keci vadanti, nāgarukkhāti attho.","<b>Nagaggesū</b>ti pabbatasikharesu.","<b>Susaṃvirūḷhā</b>ti suṭṭhu samantato virūḷhamūlā hutvā parito upari ca sammadeva sañjātasākhaggapallavappasākhāti attho.","<b>Udaggameghena navena sittā</b>ti paṭhamuppannena uḷārena mahatā pāvusameghena abhippavuṭṭhā.","<b>Vivekakāmassā</b>ti kilesavivittaṃ cittavivekaṃ icchantassa, araññavāsena tāva kāyaviveko laddho, idāni upadhivivekādhigamassa nissayabhūto cittaviveko laddhabboti taṃ patthayamānassa, jāgariyaṃ anuyuñjantassāti attho, tenāha <b>“araññasaññino”</b>ti.","Araññavāso nāma satthārā vaṇṇito thomito.","So ca kho yāvadeva samathavipassanābhāvanāpāripūriyā, tasmā sā mayā hatthagatā kātabbāti evaṃ araññagatasaññino nekkhammasaṅkappabahulassāti attho.","<b>Janetī</b>ti uppādenti, puthutte hi idaṃ ekavacanaṃ.","Keci pana “janentī”ti paṭhanti.","<b>Bhiyyo</b>ti uparūpari.","<b>Usabhassā</b>ti attānameva paraṃ viya vadati.","<b>Kalyata</b>nti kalyabhāvaṃ cittassa kammaññataṃ bhāvanāyogyataṃ.","Svāyamattho heṭṭhā vuttoyeva.","Evaṃ thero imaṃ gāthaṃ vadantoyeva vipassanaṃ ussukkāpetvā arahattaṃ pāpuṇi.","Tena vuttaṃ <b>apadāne</b> (apa. thera 1.16.25-29) –"],"lineRefs":[["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"],["thag1.110:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["thag1.110:1.1","nagā",0,0],["thag1.110:1.1","nagaggesū",0,1],["thag1.110:1.1","susaṃvirūḷhā",0,2],["thag1.110:1.1","udaggameghena navena sittā",0,3],["thag1.110:1.3","araññasaññino",0,4],["thag1.110:1.3","vivekakāmassā",0,4],["thag1.110:1.3","janetī",0,7],["thag1.110:1.3","bhiyyo",0,9],["thag1.110:1.3","usabhassā",0,10],["thag1.110:1.3","kalyataṃ",0,11]],"before":[{"para":2670,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā"]},{"para":2671,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["<b>Nagā nagaggesu susaṃvirūḷhā</b>ti āyasmato usabhattherassa gāthā.","Kā uppati?","Ayampi purimabuddhesu katādhikāro tattha tattha bhave vivaṭṭūpanissayāni puññāni karonto ito ekatiṃse kappe sikhissa bhagavato kāle devaputto hutvā nibbatto ekadivasaṃ satthāraṃ disvā pasannamānaso dibbapupphehi pūjaṃ akāsi.","Sā pupphapūjā sattāhaṃ pupphamaṇḍapākārena aṭṭhāsi.","Devamanussānaṃ mahāsamāgamo ahosi.","So tena puññakammena devamanussesu saṃsaranto imasmiṃ buddhuppāde kosalaraṭṭhe ibbhakule nibbatti, tassa <b>usabho</b>ti nāmaṃ ahosi.","So viññutaṃ patto jetavanapaṭiggahaṇe satthari laddhappasādo pabbajitvā katapubbakicco araññe pabbatapāde viharati.","Tena ca samayena pāvusakālameghe abhippavuṭṭhe pabbatasikharesu rukkhagacchalatāya ghanapaṇṇasaṇḍino honti.","Athekadivasaṃ thero leṇato nikkhamitvā taṃ vanarāmaṇeyyakaṃ pabbatarāmaṇeyyakañca disvā yonisomanasikāravasena “imepi nāma rukkhādayo acetanā utusampattiyā vaḍḍhiṃ pāpuṇanti, atha kasmā nāhaṃ utusappāyaṃ labhitvā guṇehi vaḍḍhiṃ pāpuṇissāmī”ti cintento – 110."]},{"para":2673,"vripara":"110","title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Nagā nagaggesu susaṃvirūḷhā, udaggameghena navena sittā;"]},{"para":2674,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Vivekakāmassa araññasaññino, janeti bhiyyo usabhassa kalyata”nti. –"]},{"para":2675,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Gāthaṃ abhāsi."]}],"after":[{"para":2677,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Devaputto ahaṃ santo, pūjayiṃ sikhināyakaṃ;"]},{"para":2678,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Mandāravena pupphena, buddhassa abhiropayiṃ."]},{"para":2679,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Sattāhaṃ chadanaṃ āsi, dibbaṃ mālaṃ tathāgate;"]},{"para":2680,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sabbe janā samāgantvā, namassiṃsu tathāgataṃ."]},{"para":2681,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;"]},{"para":2682,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi, buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ."]},{"para":2683,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Ito ca dasame kappe, rājāhosiṃ jutindharo;"]},{"para":2684,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Sattaratanasampanno, cakkavattī mahabbalo."]},{"para":2685,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ…pe… kataṃ buddhassa sāsana”nti."]},{"para":2686,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ayameva ca therassa aññābyākaraṇagāthā ahosīti."]},{"para":2687,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."]},{"para":2688,"vripara":null,"title":"Usabhattheragāthāvaṇṇanā","lines":["Ekādasamavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 12."]}]},"tika":null,"tika2":null}
